    "Optimized resource shrinking isn't enabled" recommendation.

build 1029 — v1.2.2 (2026-07-31). Bug fixes only. Build config unchanged from
1028 (AGP 8.12.3 / Gradle 8.13), which cleared 3 of Play's 4 recommendations.
  * FIX: "Add friend" on a suggested post showed a raw database error
