build 1027 — v1.2.2 release (2026-07-31). Since 1026 (v1.2.1):
  * ALL FAKE ENGAGEMENT NUMBERS REMOVED. getSimulatedStats() invented view and
    "reach" figures from a hash of the item id (2,000-100,000 range) and showed
    them as real. Deleted. Numbers now come from real sources only: posts from
    feed_events via get_post_view_counts(), stories from story_views (counts
    only, never viewer names), profiles from profile_views. "Reach", "Trending"
    and "Top post" had no real source anywhere and are gone entirely rather
    than estimated.
  * Official account is FOLLOW-ONLY again. The feed Add-friend button called the
    mutation directly and bypassed the rule, so real friend requests reached the
    official account. Now enforced in three places: the feed marks admin authors
    unavailable so no button renders, the mutation refuses, and a BEFORE INSERT
    trigger on friendships rejects the row.
  * Profile photo is mandatory: accounts with no DP are gated on next open.
  * Home page: Google Play badge in the footer, duplicate copyright removed.

